- **Marcus Lindqvist's total:** Git shows three identities for him: `<email redacted>` (634 lines), `mlindqvist@corp.example` (322) and `<email redacted>` (64). There is no `.mailmap`, so I merged them by name. All three commits touch the completion feature on 2026-10-21. Without the merge, his largest single identity would not make the top five. Confirm they are the same person.
